# Agen — Skema Penamaan (Gunung)

| Nama | Peran | Siapa |
|---|---|---|
| **Semeru** | Architect, spec, debug, verifikasi lokal | Claude Code |
| **Rinjani** | Builder — koding, refactor, test, siapkan commit/PR | Cursor (default) |
| **Krakatau** | Infra/deploy — `--remote`, `wrangler deploy`, `secret put`, SSH VPS | Cursor (HANYA setelah user acc eksplisit) |
| **Ijen** | Reviewer — code-review / ultrareview | User-triggered |
